  "description": "For The Extremes\n\nRide Your Favorite Trail All Year Long\n\nAdventure's best friend. Conquer any terrain with the Kings Peak's 27.5 x 4.5 tire clearance. The larger wheels and tires provide a stable and capable ride, allowing you to roll smoothly over loose and soft terrain and have maximum grip on rough and rocky trails.\n\nFull Carbon for the Full Experience\n\nThe Kings Peak features a full carbon frame and fork which is not only lightweight but also provides the strength and durability needed to conquer various terrain. Our MonoForm frame construction sets the foundation for a high-performance fat bike designed to handle the toughest conditions.\n\nAdventure-Focused Frame Geometry\n\nExperience the King Peak's progressive frame geometry for the most demanding adventures. The stable 67-degree head tube angle enhances control, offering a confident ride over diverse landscapes. Coupled with a comfortable 75-degree seat tube angle that helps you pedal efficiently and powerfully. The low standover height accommodates riders of all sizes, and the design allows for longer dropper seat posts.\n\nTake your Gear and Tools Along for the Ride\n\nGear up for any adventure with the Kings Peak's impressive 19 mounting points. Carry all your essential gear, tools, and water easily. All the mounts ensure you're well-equipped for extended rides, bikepacking trips, or any adventure that demands extra storage.",
